🎂 Suggestion for a Quake Fruit Rework ⚡

Hello, Blox Fruits Team!
I’d like to suggest a complete rework for the Quake Fruit, one of the most iconic fruits in the game, but nowadays it feels outdated compared to the newer ones.

The Quake has an amazing concept and powerful visuals, but its skill kit feels limited, with long cooldowns and low impact in PvP and raids. It deserves something more worthy of its name — after all, it’s the fruit of one of the most legendary characters in the original story.

💡 Improvement ideas:

Add a basic click attack like many modern fruits have;

Improve hitbox accuracy and casting speed;

Rework the Awakening transformation with more dynamic effects and stronger AoE attacks;

Make the fruit more viable in both PvE and PvP, while keeping its unique “earthquake” style and visual impact.


The Quake Fruit deserves to shine again and could easily become one of the most respected fruits in the game with a proper rework! 🌊💥

